OL,3,GNEWSACar in river triggers large rescue
OL,4,Aeffort
OL,5,
OL,6,FA car has entered a river prompting a
OL,7,Flarge rescue response from emergency
OL,8,Fservices.
OL,10,FNorthumbria Police is asking people to
OL,11,Favoid the area by the River Wear in
OL,12,FSunderland, near to Wearmouth Bridge,
OL,13,Fwhere a cordon is in place.
OL,15,FThe force said it received a report of
OL,16,Fa car going into the river at about
OL,17,F13:30 BST and emergency services were
OL,18,Fat the scene.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
